vuln.details_template:
{{input_type}} input <strong><span class="bb-dark">{{input_name}}</span></strong> was set to <strong><span class="bb-dark">{{test_value}}</span></strong><br/><br/>
{{#details}}A DNS request was initiated for a <strong>.bxss.me</strong> subdomain which indicates that the web application is vulnerable to RCE.<br/> DNS request details: <br/><pre><span class="bb-blue">{{.}}</span></pre>{{/details}}
{{#matched_text}}Possible execution result: <pre><span class="bb-blue">{{.}}</span></pre>{{/matched_text}}
{{#reflection_point}}The input is reflected in: <strong><span class="bb-dark">{{.}}</span></strong>{{/reflection_point}}
{{#proof_title}}<strong>Proof of Exploit</strong><br/>{{proof_title}}<br/><pre>{{proof_contents}}</pre>{{/proof_title}}
